{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_sett_grit": {
        "skill": "【附加包】把周围的敌人全部<#ef5350ff>拉<>到面前对撞，造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>；两侧都拉到人时全部<#ef5350ff>眩晕<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>，否则<#ef5350ff>减速<><#ffb900ff>50%<>。之后两拳为<#ff9028ff>屈人之威<>：额外<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20%<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<>最大生命值伤害，移速+<#ffb900ff>30%<>。<#ef5350ff>眩晕<>英雄后<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>内，蓄意轰拳整拳都是<#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】受到的伤害积攒为<#e8d44dff>豪意<>（最多<#ffb900ff>50%<>最大生命，<#ffb900ff>4秒<>消散）。消耗豪意获得<#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20%<><#e8d44dff>护盾<>，蓄力前轰一拳：<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，正中的敌人再受<#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30%<><#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>。护盾再加上全部豪意，正中的真伤再加<#ffb900ff>25%<>豪意。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_sett_grit": {
        "skill": "【附加包】把周圍的敵人全部<#ef5350ff>拉<>到面前對撞，造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>；兩側都拉到人時全部<#ef5350ff>暈眩<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>，否則<#ef5350ff>緩速<><#ffb900ff>50%<>。之後兩拳為<#ff9028ff>懾人猛拳<>：額外<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20%<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<>最大生命傷害，移速+<#ffb900ff>30%<>。<#ef5350ff>暈眩<>英雄後<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>內，蓄意轟拳整拳都是<#f5f5f5ff>真實傷害<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】受到的傷害累積為<#e8d44dff>拳皇恆毅<>（最多<#ffb900ff>50%<>最大生命，<#ffb900ff>4秒<>消散）。消耗拳皇恆毅獲得<#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20%<><#e8d44dff>護盾<>，蓄力前轟一拳：<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>，正中的敵人再受<#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30%<><#f5f5f5ff>真實傷害<>。護盾再加上全部拳皇恆毅，正中的真傷再加<#ffb900ff>25%<>拳皇恆毅。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_sett_grit": {
        "skill": "[Add-on] Sett pulls in every enemy around him for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>: with enemies on both sides all are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, else <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>50%<>. His next two punches (<#ff9028ff>Knuckle Down<>) deal <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% AD<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<> of max health more and he gains <#ffb900ff>30%<> move speed. For <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> after it <#ef5350ff>stuns<> a champion, Haymaker's whole fist deals <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Passive: Sett stores the damage he takes as <#e8d44dff>Grit<> (up to <#ffb900ff>50%<> max health, lost after <#ffb900ff>4s<>). He spends it on a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20% AD<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and winds up a punch: <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies in the middle also take <#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>. The shield also adds all his Grit, the middle's true damage <#ffb900ff>25%<> of it."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_sett_grit": {
        "skill": "[확장] 주변 적을 모두 <#ef5350ff>끌어당겨<> 맞부딪쳐 <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 입힙니다. 양쪽에서 끌어오면 모두 <#ffb900ff>1초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>, 아니면 <#ffb900ff>50%<> <#ef5350ff>둔화<>. 다음 두 주먹은 <#ff9028ff>주먹다짐<>: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20%<> + 최대 체력의 <#ffb900ff>4%<> 추가 피해, 이동 속도 +<#ffb900ff>30%<>. 챔피언을 <#ef5350ff>기절<>시킨 뒤 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 동안 강펀치는 주먹 전체가 <#f5f5f5ff>고정 피해<>입니다.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 받은 피해가 <#e8d44dff>투지<>로 쌓입니다(최대 체력의 <#ffb900ff>50%<>, <#ffb900ff>4초<> 후 소멸). 투지를 소모해 <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20%<> <#e8d44dff>보호막<>을 얻고 기를 모아 주먹을 날립니다: <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>, 중앙의 적은 <#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30%<> <#f5f5f5ff>고정 피해<> 추가. 보호막에 투지 전부, 중앙 고정 피해에 투지의 <#ffb900ff>25%<> 추가."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_sett_grit": {
        "skill": "【拡張】周囲の敵を全員<#ef5350ff>引き寄せ<>てぶつけ、<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。両側からなら全員<#ef5350ff>スタン<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>、片側なら<#ffb900ff>50%<><#ef5350ff>スロウ<>。次の2発は<#ff9028ff>ナックルダウン<>：<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20%<> + 最大体力の<#ffb900ff>4%<>を追加、移動速度+<#ffb900ff>30%<>。チャンピオンを<#ef5350ff>スタン<>させて<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>間、ヘイメーカーは拳全体が<#f5f5f5ff>確定ダメージ<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】受けたダメージを<#e8d44dff>闘魂<>として蓄積（最大体力の<#ffb900ff>50%<>まで、<#ffb900ff>4秒<>で消滅）。消費して<#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20%<>の<#e8d44dff>シールド<>、溜めて殴り<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>、中央の敵には<#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30%<>の<#f5f5f5ff>確定ダメージ<>も。シールドに闘魂すべて、中央の確定に闘魂の<#ffb900ff>25%<>を追加。"
      }
    }
  }
}
